# Father Care Bakery Management System

**A Computerized Web-Based Platform for Automated Operations, Inventory Tracking, and Online Ordering**

This project is a full-stack web application built to digitally transform the manual operations of Father Care Bakery. It replaces paper-based records and phone orders with a centralized, real-time management system, reducing inventory waste, eliminating manual calculation errors, and providing customers with 24/7 access to the bakery catalog.



